<description>&lt;p&gt;Colombian forces are expanding a military offensive along the Venezuela border, deploying troops after a Venezuelan airstrike hit an ELN guerrilla camp, killing combatants and civilians. The government has tightened surrender terms and passed a law that removes the political status of rebels, treating them as ordinary criminals. The United Nations has renewed its mission in Colombia, while the United States is reported to have participated in a bombing operation against the ELN in Venezuela. The conflict recorded 225 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiowFBVV95cUxPVkQyTU5QLS1RV0N3SU1iekhjb2pIbmpEOGJOZUZYaFA2di1zVXdQa0RHNjRmODhJYWRPSVFfWlZXNmFvM2F1YVdydHNzaWZQRHVjOUJDTkt2VHhSQXgwNkdYdlZQVXlpWTJCNVRyZG1hLWdEdG9zdllaLS0zX0Z1UHhnaTF4TzY2Tkt3N1NlNkZvTjQyYk9zZl9OY1VWVmc1bFY4?oc=5&quot;&gt;Mail &amp;amp; Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiygFBVV95cUxOYmJTMW1BMXg5NU1mSk1iMVBJNVhyQWx2ZTFZSGhDSnFVaE1Vb1NpdHluRXFCakdTVXhpV1NmeFkzT3hQVi0wazJZV2hUcExFbkd0TEcwSlV6SkNaTXVPS3JkYkRWaDhnY25nRUFZaEIwSjRxOFhST1VnbVM1LU5TNmRISnlRQ1RhZ2NHZnV2S3lhcEpZMjRYNk5GcGlMWDVXRWNXSWxkdDlXR0FVSkI5bDFLVkZmNkQxcnNlWFJRSERLR2R3MVFuYUdn?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqwFBVV95cUxQV2JtLTUxR2RiTmlwNnljTDdjcDVjeHVkYVg0QktsS0tiUVhCOVBWMGNfejJTbG1MNUNOQ2lFZnhla3hGTDJ2eVFXRG14Yjk3am8wM3gyQ3E5b1ZGRzNoalJMQ0I1MXUxbDdUMkRJdmZucFNXWTFFTkZUN3Vpc0FVeWRiYzM0Sno1cS1JNTZrTG1BbmRiQk54Z3RuWllZOF96NjkyZkRoQzdvYWs?oc=5&quot;&gt;WSJ&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimwFBVV95cUxPb2p4akFMdUxTeWtlSkhaLXZBdXdyWkZLSFlPMm1EbDhGelRsUVlxV0N3cnYwZlZZemZiQWRrdTM0RVhhTG5PbDVVcy0xaVNEVW56d2FEYnA0ZGs2aEpnSFlmV2FuV3NHZ1F3N1pENC1Xa2JGeWJ3emo4eGY3ZkdHODEzcFMyUWYyRU9LQ1NjM1J